__scene

section__
  @title "T193 - ACT3 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-stormlands/frame-193.jpg"

  "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky throws you into a siege belt where loyalty changes with provisions and wind. Cold rain needles your face while mud swallows wagon wheels and bowstrings sag in the damp. Renly loyalists and Stannis hardliners trade insults behind formal courtesies while quartermasters beg you to choose one front to feed. What you promised in earlier fronts now returns as competing obligations at every gatehouse and shoreline battery.

Your choice determines whether these lords obey a shared chain of command or merely tolerate each other until the next breach. This module is claim enforcement under siege pressure: lawful sequencing earns legitimacy but can lose castles to weather windows, while covert pressure speeds compliance and poisons the alliance you need for the final wars.

You balance strategy against attrition in plain numbers: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. Whatever you choose, someone will call it betrayal and someone else will call it survival."

  choice__
    @target "T194 - ACT3 - Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Declare precedence in open war council, risk elite resentment, and keep command coherent through documented obligations."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T195 - ACT3 - Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Route pressure through cutouts and paid informers, spend secrecy and moral capital, and break opposition before sunrise."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T194 - ACT3 - Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-stormlands/frame-194.jpg"

  "Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse throws you into a campaign where weather punishes hesitation harder than steel. The storm never fully breaks, and every road smells of churned earth, horse blood, and drenched pine. Stormlords demand clear claim enforcement, siege captains demand supply certainty, and each waits for proof that your command outranks their grudges. The hard compromises of Act Two bought you a temporary coalition, but in the Stormlands that coalition fractures under inheritance claims and delayed pay.

Every hour spent debating rightful command costs stone walls, grain stores, and morale, yet every rushed verdict creates another rival with a grievance. Your choice determines whether these lords obey a shared chain of command or merely tolerate each other until the next breach.

The campaign compresses to the same grim accounting: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. The weather will not wait for a cleaner decision."

  choice__
    @target "T195 - ACT3 - Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Issue terms in open court, spend reputation for legal clarity, and bind commanders to enforceable quotas before witnesses."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T196 - ACT3 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 7)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Use deniable arrests and forged correspondence, buy short-term control with long-term distrust, and isolate rival captains quietly."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T195 - ACT3 - Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-stormlands/frame-195.jpg"

  "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors throws you into a coastline of broken keeps and impatient claimants. Salt wind and wet leather fill the command tent as messengers stomp in with torn cloaks and worse news. Scouts report shifting picket lines at dawn, and every captain blames the rain for decisions that were political from the start. Act Two burned through men and stores in the Riverlands and North, and now every siege timetable is built on thinner reserves than anyone admits.

If you prioritize one banner publicly, you gain a reliable spearpoint and risk a broader defection; if you broker secret concessions, you keep numbers now and invite revenge once the storm passes. Every hour spent debating rightful command costs stone walls, grain stores, and morale, yet every rushed verdict creates another rival with a grievance.

You balance strategy against attrition in plain numbers: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. Whatever you choose, someone will call it betrayal and someone else will call it survival."

  choice__
    @target "T196 - ACT3 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Publish the order under seal, accept immediate political heat, and force every allied banner to comply on record."
