You balance strategy against attrition in plain numbers: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. Whatever you choose, someone will call it betrayal and someone else will call it survival."

  choice__
    @target "T216 - ACT3 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Announce penalties in daylight, trade speed for legitimacy, and make your own name answerable with the rest."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T217 - ACT3 - Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Broker secret concessions between rival stormlords, pay in hidden promises, and keep the siege timetable intact."
