section__
  @title "T216 - ACT3 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-stormlands/frame-216.jpg"

  "Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower throws you into a theater of banners, rain, and disputed succession. Thunder rolls over flooded fields, and campfires hiss out faster than squires can relight them. Banner heirs press for visible favoritism, and veteran sergeants ask whether your promises survive the next weather turn. The realm survived Act Two by triage; in this theater, triage now looks like favoritism unless you enforce terms in public.

This module is claim enforcement under siege pressure: lawful sequencing earns legitimacy but can lose castles to weather windows, while covert pressure speeds compliance and poisons the alliance you need for the final wars. If you prioritize one banner publicly, you gain a reliable spearpoint and risk a broader defection; if you broker secret concessions, you keep numbers now and invite revenge once the storm passes.

The campaign compresses to the same grim accounting: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. The weather will not wait for a cleaner decision."

  choice__
    @target "T217 - ACT3 - Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Set claim terms before all banners, spend political capital on fairness, and hold the siege line under one legal chain."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T218 - ACT3 - Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 5)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Use deniable envoys to split the loudest claim bloc, spend secrecy for speed, and secure one breach window before weather turns."
  __choice
__section
